  "description": "<p>Triples in HTTP response currently reference internal Fedora IDs rather than their external URI. Here's an example of what's currently returned for a TimeMap:</p>\n\n<p>```&lt;info:fedora/version-test/fcr:versions&gt;<br/>\n        ldp:contains         &lt;info:fedora/version-test/fcr:versions/20200306203708&gt; ;<br/>\n        memento:original     &lt;info:fedora/version-test&gt; ;<br/>\n        fedora:created       \"2020-03-06T20:36:58.579161Z\" ;<br/>\n        fedora:lastModified  \"2020-03-06T20:36:58.579161Z\" ;<br/>\n        rdf:type             fedora:TimeMap ;<br/>\n        rdf:type             memento:TimeMap .```</p>\n\n<p>And what a TimeMap looks like in F5:</p>\n\n<p>```&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions</a>&gt;<br/>\n        rdf:type               fedora:TimeMap ;<br/>\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;<br/>\n        rdf:type               memento:TimeMap ;<br/>\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"bypassAdmin\" ;<br/>\n        fedora:createdBy       \"bypassAdmin\" ;<br/>\n        fedora:created         \"2020-03-06T20:41:16.101Z\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2020-03-06T20:41:57.176Z\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        memento:original       &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;<br/>\n        ldp:contains           &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions/20200306204157\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions/20200306204157</a>&gt; .```</p>",
